do GameManager.lock_player()
do CutSceneManager.start_cutscene()
ShopMan: Not bad for your first run, kid!
ShopMan: But listen, there's something they don't tell you about the extermination business. It ain't all glory and heroics. Sometimes, you've gotta do the dirty work.
ShopMan: Literally.
ShopMan: Those Vermin have been leaving Mounds all over town, and someone's gotta clean 'em up. Unfortunately, that someone is you!
ShopMan: But don't look so glum! There's a bright side to all this...
ShopMan: IT'S LUCRATIVE!
ShopMan: Destroy those Mounds and bring me the green crystals inside. They're perfectly safe, by the way. Probably.
ShopMan: You can trade 'em in for some nice weapon upgrades. It's a rite of passage for every rookie exterminator!
ShopMan: Now hurry! We've got a town to clean, and that timer ain't gonna wait!
[wait time="1.0"]
do CutSceneManager.end_cutscene()
do GameManager.unlock_player()
[wait time="1.2"]
do CutSceneManager.start_hunt_countdown()